sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as content script
    participant SW as service worker
    participant OD as offscreen document

    Note over SW: cache in chrome.storage.session
    Note over OD: session and queue

    CS->>SW: evaluate
    SW->>SW: look up cache
    alt cache hit
        SW-->>CS: shouldShow
    else cache miss
        SW->>OD: evaluate
        OD->>OD: wait in queue
        OD->>OD: evaluate with Gemini Nano
        OD-->>SW: shouldShow
        SW->>SW: store in cache
        SW-->>CS: shouldShow
    end
    CS->>CS: show or collapse
